
   .:[ local cube zenka command access permission setup ]:.

    ## local developer account ## [ removing later., ] ## <system.admin-user> ##
    access.cmd.usr.<admin-user>  =  ** ..*.**
    access.cmd.usr.<unix-admin>  =  ** ..*.**

    ## devmod commands : only reachable while devmod is loaded on THIS     ##
    ## zenka [ v7-zenki.devmod-enable is not network-reachable here --     ##
    ## cube-13 is not v7-zenki-managed -- but the universal base.sig_NUM53 ##
    ## handler still answers a direct local signal, so this grant matters  ##
    ## once loaded ]                                                       ##
    access.devcmd.usr.<admin-user>  =  devmod:*
    access.devcmd.usr.<unix-admin>  =  devmod:*

    ### adjust as desired ###
    access.cmd.usr.unix-root   =  zulum.*

